  "details": "A vulnerability was determined in feelec-yishu feelcrm-os 1.0.0. This affects an unknown part of the file App/Feelcrm/Index/Controller/GoogleController.class.php of the component getCurlData Endpoint. Executing a manipulation of the argument url can lead to server-side request forgery. It is possible to launch the attack remotely. The exploit has been publicly disclosed and may be utilized. The project was informed of the problem early through an issue report but has not responded yet.",
